      "markdown": "### Inspecting Full OpenTelemetry Trace Waterfalls & Logs in Dynatrace\n\n1. **Distributed Traces (`invoke_agent` -> `call_llm` -> `execute_tool`)**:\n   - Open **Distributed Tracing** in Dynatrace and filter by `service.name = adk-ops-agent`.\n   - Click any trace (`invoke_agent OpsAgent`) to inspect child `call_llm` and `execute_tool` spans along with `gen_ai.*` span attributes.\n2. **Correlated GenAI Prompt/Completion Events & Logs**:\n   - Open **Logs & Events** and filter by `service.name = adk-ops-agent` (or `event.name = gen_ai.client.inference.operation.details`).\n   - Every log record carries `trace_id` and `span_id` for 1-click jump between logs and trace waterfalls.\n3. **DQL Query for Grail Notebooks / Dashboards**:\n   ```dql\n   fetch spans\n   | filter service.name == \"adk-ops-agent\"\n   | sort start_time desc\n   | fields start_time, span.name, duration, gen_ai.agent.name, gen_ai.tool.name, gen_ai.request.model, trace.id\n   ```"
    }
